<section aria-labelledby="specs-title" class="bg-ink text-ink-foreground" id="specs"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 py-20 md:px-8 md:py-28"><div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10"><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 lg:col-span-4" style="transition-delay:0ms"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ember">Specifications</p><h2 class="mt-5 font-heading text-[clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.5rem)] leading-[0.96] tracking-[-0.02em]" id="specs-title">The details, <em class="italic text-ember">plainly.</em></h2><p class="mt-6 max-w-sm text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-foreground/70">Targets for the first production units, measured in lived-in homes rather than a lab.</p><div class="mt-10 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ink-foreground/60">Knit finishes</p><ul class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-5"><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-9 rounded-full ring-1 ring-white/20 ring-offset-2 ring-offset-ink bg-[oklch(0.84_0.035_78)]"></span><span class="text-[15px]">Oat</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-9 rounded-full ring-1 ring-white/20 ring-offset-2 ring-offset-ink bg-[oklch(0.46_0.012_250)]"></span><span class="text-[15px]">Slate</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-9 rounded-full ring-1 ring-white/20 ring-offset-2 ring-offset-ink bg-[oklch(0.62_0.08_45)]"></span><span class="text-[15px]">Clay</span></li></ul><p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-foreground/60">Covers unzip and go in a normal wash. Swap colours whenever you redecorate.</p></div></div><div class="grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:col-span-8 xl:grid-cols-3"><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 bg-ink p-6 md:p-7" style="transition-delay:0ms"><h3 class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ember">Body</h3><dl class="mt-5 flex flex-col"><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Height</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">165 cm</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Weight</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">32 kg</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Carry</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">Up to 12 kg</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Exterior</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">Washable knit over padded panels</dd></div></dl></div><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 bg-ink p-6 md:p-7" style="transition-delay:60ms"><h3 class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ember">Movement</h3><dl class="mt-5 flex flex-col"><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Joints</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">30 in the body</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Walking pace</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">Up to 1.1 m/s indoors</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Stairs</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">Up to 20 cm per step</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Noise</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">Under 45 dB while walking</dd></div></dl></div><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 bg-ink p-6 md:p-7" style="transition-delay:120ms"><h3 class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ember">Hands</h3><dl class="mt-5 flex flex-col"><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Degrees of freedom</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">16 per hand</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Touch</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">Tactile pad in every fingertip</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Grip</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">0.1 to 60 N</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Cameras</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">One in each wrist</dd></div></dl></div><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 bg-ink p-6 md:p-7" style="transition-delay:180ms"><h3 class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ember">Perception</h3><dl class="mt-5 flex flex-col"><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Vision</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">Stereo cameras with depth</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Range</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">0.2 to 6 m</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Hearing</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">Six-microphone array</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Privacy</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">Physical camera shutter</dd></div></dl></div><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 bg-ink p-6 md:p-7" style="transition-delay:240ms"><h3 class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ember">Power</h3><dl class="mt-5 flex flex-col"><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Runtime</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">About 4 h of typical use</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Charging</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">80% in 60 min</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Dock</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">Finds and returns on its own</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Battery</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">Swappable, in the torso</dd></div></dl></div><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 bg-ink p-6 md:p-7" style="transition-delay:300ms"><h3 class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ember">Intelligence</h3><dl class="mt-5 flex flex-col"><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Compute</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">On board, works offline</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Voice</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">Speaks and listens in English</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">Updates</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">New skills every month</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0"><dt class="text-[13px] text-ink-foreground/55">App</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground">iOS and Android</dd></div></dl></div></div></div><p class="mt-8 text-sm text-ink-foreground/50">Specifications describe first production units and may change before delivery. Runtime depends on the tasks and the home.</p></div></section>